      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464648506449920
    m_Localized: Quick Hand makes your reload faster just like reload go brrrrrrrrrrrrr
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464695826587648
    m_Localized: This makes you jump VERY HIGH so you can go to space, Kinda like
      a frog if you catch my drift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464729955639296
    m_Localized: If you are blind and cannot see where your getting hit at, this
      perk can help you
